Hi {Owner},

I help coffee shops and cafés around {City} with their Google profile and website. {Business Name} has loyal regulars and great reviews, but the hours online don't all match, and there's no menu or beans page a newcomer can read on a phone.

I built a sample first rather than ask for your time: the drinks menu as text, hours that match Google, a laptop and wifi section, coffee catering boxes, an events calendar and a beans shelf, with marked placeholders where your photos would go:

{demo-link}

If you want it, I move it to a domain you own and finish it for {Build Range}, plus {Care Range} a month for hosting and keeping hours and menu right. If not, no problem, it comes down at the end of the month.

Worth ten minutes after the lunch lull?

{Your Name}
{Your Studio} · {Your Phone}
{Your Physical Address}

Reply "stop" and I won't contact you again.
